<title>UK: Grupo Bipop prices 220 bln lire convertible bond.</title>
<headline>Grupo Bipop prices 220 bln lire convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated convertible bond has been priced, lead manager Morgan Stanley said. The issue size has been increased to 220 billion lire from 200 billion lire.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GRUPO BIPOP (BANCA POPOLARE DI BRESCIA )</p>
<p> AMT    220 BLN LIRE  COUPON     7.00	MATURITY    01.JAN.03</p>
<p> TYPE   CONVERTIBLE   ISS PRICE  PAR	 LISTING     LUX</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	MGT/UND    1.00	SELL CONC   1.50</p>
<p> PAY DATE   07.FEB.97</p>
<p> NOTES	CONVERSION PRICE IS 9,600 LIRE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
